\[
2 i \tan(\pi \kappa) = \frac{2 \pi i \, \Gamma_{ab}^c \, \Gamma_c^{ab}}{M_c \cdot i \sin(\pi \kappa)}
\]

Simplify:

\[
\tan(\pi \kappa) = \frac{\pi \, \Gamma_{ab}^c \, \Gamma_c^{ab}}{M_c \sin(\pi \kappa)}
\]

\[
\Gamma_{ab}^c \, \Gamma_c^{ab} = \frac{M_c}{\pi} \sin(\pi \kappa) \tan(\pi \kappa) = \frac{M_c}{\pi} \sin^2(\pi \kappa) / \cos(\pi \kappa)
